# Platform — core

- **Role**: multi-tenant Cloudflare zone policy + shared Grafana Free objects for isolated app repos.
- **Dependency**: apps → this repo only; never app → app.
- **Do**: manage `shared-edge` / `shared-obs` / bootstrap; keep docs in `docs/architecture.md` and ADRs 0001–0002 accurate.
- **Don’t**: host app site content, app AWS site stacks, or per-app Grafana dashboards here (platform cost overview in `shared-obs` is OK — ADR 0002).
- **GitHub**: `staging` → `main` promote path; same security floor as Block Drop (`docs/github-branch-protection.md`) — public repo, Dependabot alerts, secret scanning + push protection, ruleset, read-only Actions token. Verify via API; do not assume create-time defaults.
- **Agents**: `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, `SECURITY.md`. Prefer small diffs. Local Terraform apply only.
